### Pareto Front Assessment (current bath: PolarClean 10 wt%)

The objectives are **Elastic Modulus** (higher = better) and **Pore Fraction** (higher = better). I need to identify non-dominated candidates from the full history, being careful to compare only within comparable bath contexts where relevant.

