Looking at experiments with the **current bath (PolarClean 10 wt%)**:
- `15-0add-9deg-bathSolv-PolarClean-10wt-250s-N2-1600s`: E=124 bar, PF=0.55 (run1, good quality)
- `15p5-0add-6deg-bathSolv-PolarClean-10wt-250s-N2-1600s` run1: E=159, PF=0.61 (minor crease)
- `15p5-0add-6deg-bathSolv-PolarClean-10wt-250s-N2-1600s` run2: E=163, PF=0.73 (clean)
